{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18514","headline":"小苑春望宫池柳色 · 欧阳詹","name":"小苑春望宫池柳色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东风韶景至，垂柳御沟新。\n媚作千门秀，连爲一道春。\n柔荑生女指，嫩叶长龙鳞。\n舞絮回青岸，翻烟拂绿苹。\n王孙初命赏，佳客欲伤神。\n芳意堪相赠，一枝先远人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18514.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18514","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}